body:
LEAD PROPOSAL — exact B0 tracker topology for chief disposition

The architecture is settled; the remaining ambiguity is tracker shape. I recommend the smallest topology that matches the decision without making optional future components block C1:

PARENT (new or repurposed)
B0 movie source-admission package and favorable source branch
- remains OPEN;
- is the only B0 bead that can satisfy the B0 side of the C1 gate;
- closes only when B0-A/C/D below have accepted artifacts/outcomes and the already-landed B0-B ledger is referenced;
- does not include P1, which remains an independent C1 prerequisite.

B0-A REQUIRED SOURCE BRANCH
- one bounded child for the exact Sherlock artifact/edition/use/access/rights decision OR an actually ratified ADR replacement naming the substitute and revising/skipping D0;
- Hold, Unknown, NotRun(RightsHold), or ADRReplacementRequired are lawful automatic results but do not close the parent;
- exact declared use, permitted/forbidden actions, expiry/recheck, owner and reviewer are mandatory.

B0-B COMPONENT LEDGER
- reuse closed bead bd-01M188P265MZVEKBD5BBN34E6T and landed cand-7MEX/f203b783 as completed evidence;
- it closes documentation only and admits no component.

B0-C REPAIR SPEC
- one documentation-only child freezing the normative two-acquisition-run repair specification plus deliberately non-Sherlock synthetic oracle;
- no executable C1 ADTs/laws and no Sherlock read.

B0-D DISCLOSURE PROTOCOL
- one documentation-only child freezing the closed aggregate disclosure schema, Established/Unestablished universe accounting, exact receipt identity tuple, and externally executable protocol;
- no source-bearing repository loader; actual validation remains D0.

EXISTING OWNER-ACTION BEAD
- keep bd-01M184XP908JX51S3ZYFX20HC7 as the broader owner-action registry, but do not make every optional row a B0 blocker;
- mark the Sherlock-or-ratified-replacement branch as the B0-required dependency;
- pyannote terms, MF2, FilmFestival REB, and future human-recall corpus actions block only a vertical that actually selects them.

Why: otherwise an optional future pyannote or MF2 decision can falsely hold the provider-free source substrate, while a simple short-table close can falsely unlock C1. This topology gives one acceptance-bearing B0 parent, a favorable required source branch, two bounded spec artifacts, and one already-closed ledger.

Chief action requested: adopt this topology or name the exact alternative. I am not creating or editing chief-owned beads without that disposition. No source read, terms acceptance, dependency, implementation, or C1/D0 authority follows.
